      "title": {
        "simpleText": "Mrs. Dunham Day"
      },
      "description": {
        "simpleText": "On June 5th 2014, Woodbury Senior-Junior Highschool held a celebration for their retiring teacher, Mrs. Dunham. The celebration included a flash mob dance including the entire school, individual performances from each grade, and a music video starring Mrs. Dunham and the community around her. Woodbury could not be more thankful for Mrs. Dunham's work throughout the years. This is a small token of their appreciation. \n\nENJOY!"
      },
