      "description": {
        "simpleText": "The S.L.A.G. (Scholars, Leaders, Athletes, Gentlemen)  club is an after school program involving all of the elementary schools in Woodbury, New Jersey. The meetings involve boys from grades 3rd to 5th, being taught school and life skills they can use to help better themselves and their communities. Enjoy!\n\nLyrics:\n\nLove to learn\nlearn to lead\nathletes and gentlemen\ntogether we succeed\nlearning right from wrong\nthrough this rap song\nS.L.A.G. is all you need!\n\nKeeping love present,\nthere's not much to it,\nresponsibility will help you do it.\nAnd all of us know that school can be tough,\nbut doing the bare minimum just ain't enough\n\nSo we go about our day\nwith determination,\nHelp to take this skill,\nspread across the nation.\nNow you know the factors of doing good,\nfollow these rules and do as you should.\n\nHelping and caring are the words we live by,\nsharing and respecting, you should give it a try.\nThese are some traits to help you lead,\nput 'em into motion, and plant the seed.\n\nKeep a good attitude, \nhelp it grow. \nKeep a cool head,\nit's perseverance, YO!\nAnd if there are times you are feeling down,\nlisten to this song and turn it around!\n\nFrom Evergreen,\ndown to Walnut Street,\nand can't forget, the West End Crew.\nTogether, we help out Woodbury,\nbe a better place, for me and you!\n\nLove to learn\nlearn to lead\nathletes and gentlemen\ntogether we succeed\nlearning right from wrong\nthrough this rap song\nS.L.A.G. is all you need!\n\nWe do not own the music. This is used for educational purposes only."
